(53,NULL,'Port of Rotterdam, the Netherlands - SW upgrade contract Port of Rotterdam','2011-03-01',2800000,0,1,'The contract ensures that the VTS software is always stable and up-to-date. PoR always has the right to use the most recent software version and to contribute to future developments of the V3000 product.','VTS','V3000',NULL,NULL,NULL,157,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-09-09 20:42:34.119','2026-09-09 20:42:34.119',1,NULL,1,0),
(54,NULL,'Port of Rotterdam, the Netherlands - VTS Simulator for Port of Rotterdam','2019-07-01',381000,0,1,'The VTS Simulator has a flexible set-up. Training sessions can be set-up with any number of instructors/ship operators and any number of trainees. The simulator has been designed in such a way that it can use the same charts as the operational VTS. Recorded traffic situations (e.g. incidents) can be imported into the simulator to serve as the starting point of a training scenario.\nIn general this next level VTS Simulator shares the same technology and traffic display as the operational VTS. Furthermore, it has a very efficient user interface to optimize the development of training scenarios.','VTS','MaritimeControl',NULL,NULL,NULL,157,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-09-09 20:42:34.148','2026-09-09 20:42:34.148',1,NULL,1,0),
(55,NULL,'VTS SRK (Scheldt Radar Chain) - SRK Applications upgrade RW+SIM','2020-01-01',4668000,0,1,'This contract ensures that the VTS and Simulator software is always stable and up-to-date. SRK has the right to use the most recent software version and to contribute to future developments of the Maritime control and Simulator products. Included in the scope is the implementation of new software versions every 2 years (on average)\nThe Scheldt Radar Network comprises the 5 SRK traffic centres (Zeebrugge, Vlissingen, Terneuzen, Hansweert and Zandvliet) and the traffic centres of Wemeldinge (NL), MRCC (BE) and MIK (BE) and for the Ports of Ghent (BE) and Zeebrugge (BE). It connects more than 50 radars, an AIS network and Information Processing System.','VTS','V3000',NULL,NULL,NULL,157,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-09-09 20:42:34.177','2026-09-09 20:42:34.177',138,NULL,1,0),
