(66,NULL,'VTS for the Port of Klaipeda, Lithuania','2015-05-01',1600133,0,1,'Klaipeda State Seaport operates 24/7 and is the most northern ice–free port on the Eastern coast of the Baltic Sea. It is the most important and biggest Lithuanian transport hub, connecting sea, land and railway routes from East to West.\nKlaipeda is a multipurpose, universal, deep-water port, providing high quality services. The annual port cargo handling capacity is up to 60 million tons.','VTS','MaritimeControl',NULL,NULL,NULL,130,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-09-09 20:42:34.469','2026-09-09 20:42:34.469',144,NULL,1,0),
