(88,NULL,'VTS Port of Tallinn and Muuga Bay (2017)','2017-01-15',558000,0,1,'A Vessel Traffic Services system for the Port of Tallinn and Muuga Bay.\nThe project comprises the delivery of two X-band radar\'s, a Tracking system, Microwave Links, Multi-sensor Fusion, seven Display Positions, Consoles, Logging and replay, Control and Monitoring, a VTS Database management System, integration of Hydro/Meteo-equipment and a GPS-based central time distribution subsystem.\nThe VTS system provides radar coverage in the port of Tallinn and Muuga Bay. A Database management System provides support to the VTS operations.\nThe maintenance contract is effective until December 2022.','VTS','MaritimeControl',NULL,NULL,NULL,70,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-09-09 20:42:34.980','2026-09-09 20:42:34.980',150,NULL,1,0),
(89,NULL,'Port of Fujairah VTS','2019-06-27',11600000,0,31,'Port of Fujairah wants to have IALA advanced operations and therefore the VTMIS system will be using an advanced Terma Solid state radar with 21 foot antenna. Furthermore the system is made redundant, has an advanced Buoy deployed in the (deep) water at the oil terminals. Everything is designed to facilitate the VTS operators with the best common operating picture.','VTS','MaritimeControl',NULL,NULL,NULL,234,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-09-09 20:42:34.997','2026-09-09 20:42:34.997',151,NULL,1,0),
